    <li>Working desktops, laptops, workstations, servers get condition-based estimates.</li>
    <li>No per-kg rate — value comes from model-specific resale demand.</li>
    <li>Working workstations and servers with recent CPUs retain more value.</li>
    <li>Non-working or older machines route to free recycling.</li>
    <li>Estimate = specs + photos; confirmed quote = physical inspection.</li>
  </ul>

